# Standard fields on Account, Case and Contact. A CustomObject retrieve returns
# every field on the object, including the DE sample schema (SLA__c,
# UpsellOpportunity__c, EngineeringReqNumber__c and friends). These are listed
# individually rather than as a directory exclusion plus negations, because the
# negation form does not survive a decomposed CustomObject retrieve: the fields
# were written back anyway. Explicit is uglier and actually works.
